        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            Simmer &amp; Sear respects your privacy. This policy explains what personal information we collect, why we collect it, how we protect it and what your rights are under the Protection of Personal Information Act 4 of 2013 (POPIA). By using this website you acknowledge that you have read this policy.
        </p>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 0.95rem;">Last updated: 28 September 2026</p>

        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">Who Is Responsible</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            Simmer &amp; Sear is the responsible party for the personal information processed through this website. Questions or requests about your information can be sent to our Information Officer at info@simmerandsear.co.za.
        </p>

        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">Information We Collect</h2>
        <ul style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            <li><strong>Account details:</strong> your name, email address and password. Passwords are stored only as a salted, one-way hash, never in plain text.</li>
            <li><strong>Order details:</strong> the items you buy, your shipping name, address, city and postal code, and your order history.</li>
            <li><strong>Trade and quotation requests:</strong> your name, email, company name, notes and any documents you attach when you request a quotation or book a sales agent.</li>
            <li><strong>Enquiries:</strong> the name, email address and message you send through the contact form.</li>
            <li><strong>Reviews:</strong> ratings and comments you submit for products you have purchased.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical information:</strong> cookies and similar data needed to keep you signed in, protect forms and remember your accessibility settings.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            We do not store your card number, expiry date or CVV. Payments are handled by our payment provider, PayFast.
        </p>

        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <ul style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            <li>To create and manage your account and sign you in securely.</li>
            <li>To process, deliver and confirm your orders and to prepare quotations for bulk orders.</li>
            <li>To respond to your enquiries and booking requests.</li>
            <li>To publish moderated product reviews.</li>
            <li>To keep the website secure, prevent fraud and keep a record of administrative actions.</li>
            <li>To meet legal and record-keeping obligations.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            We only collect the information we need for these purposes, and we do not sell your personal information.
        </p>

        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">Who We Share It With</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            We share information only with service providers who help us run the website, and only as far as they need it: PayFast to process payments, Brevo to send email notifications, Microsoft Azure to host the application and MongoDB Atlas to store data. We may also disclose information where the law requires it.
        </p>

        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">Data Security</h2>
        <ul style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            <li>All traffic is encrypted over HTTPS.</li>
            <li>Passwords are hashed with a salted, industry-standard algorithm.</li>
            <li>Access to administrative functions is limited by role, and every administrative action is recorded in an audit log.</li>
            <li>The database is reachable only from our application, with restricted credentials.</li>
            <li>Our application is hosted in the South Africa North region.</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            No online system is completely risk-free, but we take reasonable technical and organisational steps to prevent loss, misuse and unauthorised access.
        </p>

        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">Cookies</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            We use only essential cookies: a sign-in cookie that keeps you logged in, a security token that protects our forms, and a preference cookie that remembers your accessibility settings. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies.
        </p>

        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">How Long We Keep Your Information</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            We keep information only as long as it is needed for the purposes above or as the law requires. Order records are retained for record-keeping purposes and cannot be deleted immediately. You can deactivate your account and sign back in at any time. If your account stays inactive for [insert period], your personal data is permanently deleted.
        </p>

        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">Your Rights</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            Under POPIA you may ask us to confirm what personal information we hold about you, to correct or update it, to delete it where we no longer have a lawful reason to keep it, and to object to its processing. You can update your email and password on your profile page. For any other request, contact our Information Officer at [insert email address]. If you are not satisfied with our response, you may lodge a complaint with the Information Regulator of South Africa.
        </p>

        <h2 style="margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 2rem;">Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 1.5rem; color: var(--ss-ink-muted); font-size: 1.125rem; line-height: 1.8;">
            We may update this policy from time to time. The date at the top shows when it was last changed.
